---
import Layout from "@/layouts/baseLayout.astro";
import EventList from "@/components/eventList.astro";
---

<Layout>
  <div class="w-full p-3 text-white bg-accent my-5">
    <span
      >Hey, welcome to Jasnowidz (<i>eng: seer, soothsayer, psychic</i>)<br
      />Right now you are looking at around 1200+ events scraped from 3 sites:
      lublin.eu, zoom.lublin.pl and labirynt.com. <br /> I'm trying to improve the
      data quality but it's really hard because some sites (labirynt) have very different
      ways of handling dates for example, and its very hard to scrape that (i plan
      to scrape the dates with ai), but anyways <br />
      <br />
      This list is not complete and the site was made pretty fast (yet to improve).
      <br />
      For reviewers: https://github.com/yehorscode/jasnowidz (Backend/ for python
      backend scripts and Frontend/ for this site's source)
    </span>
  </div>
  <EventList />
</Layout>
